      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eureka%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Eureka sits in northeastern Greenbush Township, about 30 miles north of Lansing and 40 miles south of Mount Pleasant in Michigan’s Lower Peninsula.",
